{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 158, "text": "ﯽﺘﻔﮔ ﻦﻣ ﻪﺑ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 159, "text": ".ﺩﻮﺑ ﻩﺪﺷ ﺏﺍﺮﺧ ﻪﻛ  "}
