{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 161, "text": "ﻢﺘﺳﺍﻮﺨﯿﻣ ، ﺐﺧ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 162, "text": "!ﻢﻨﻛ  ﺕﺍ ﻩﺩﺯ ﺖﻔﮕﺷ"}
