{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 203, "text": ";^_^ ﻡﺩﺮﮑﯿﻣ ﺕﺎﮕﻧ ﻢﺘﺷﺍﺩ ﯽﮑﺷﺍﻮﯾ ﺕﺭﻮﺼﺑ ﻦﻣ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 205, "text": ".ﺖﺴﯿﻧ ﺖﺳﺭﺩ ﯽﻠﯿﺧ ﻦﯾﺍ ﺪﯾﺎﺷ ...ﻡﺍ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 206, "text": "ﻝﺎﺣ ﺮﻫ ﻪﺑ ﺎﻣﺍ "}
