{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 210, "text": ".ﻡﺪﯾﺪﻧ ﻥﻭﺭﺎﺑ ﺎﺠﻨﯾﺍ ﺖﻗﻭ ﭻﯿﻫ ﺎﻣﺍ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 211, "text": "؟ﻢﯿﺷﺎﺑ ﻪﺘﺷﺍﺩ ﺮﺘﭼ ﺪﯾﺎﺑ ﺍﺮﭼ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 213, "text": ".ﻢﻛ  ﯽﻠﯿﺧ ﻂﻘﻓ—ﻩﺭﺎﺒﯿﻣ ﻥﻭﺭﺎﺑ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 214, "text": ".ىﺪﯾﺪﻧ ﺯﻮﻨﻫ ﻮﺗ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 215, "text": ".ﯽﻨﯿﺒﺑ ﺯﻭﺭ ﻪﯾ ﺪﯾﺎﺷ "}
