{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 221, "text": "،ﻢﯿﺘﺴﻫ ىﺯﺎﺑ ﻪﯾ ىﻮﺗ ﻪﮔﺍ ﻭ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 222, "text": "؟ﻪﯿﭼ ىﺍﺮﺑ ﻦﯾﺍ "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 224, "text": "،ًﺎﻟﻭﺍ "}
